{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nMH56mTEUc1795255102.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今年的樂施毅行者賽事有近5,000名選手參與。</p><p></p><p>其中100公里賽事選手，早上陸續抵達終點。他們昨日由西貢北潭涌出發，終點是屯門哈羅香港國際學校。</p><p></p><p>今年新增20公里路線，四人一組，由大帽山扶輪公園出發前往終點，參加者須在八小時內完成。漁護署署長黎堅明連同三名立法會議員組隊，一起衝線。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:43:50.652546+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:17.259287+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:37:14.891411+00:00","content_hash":"72fe933f5ca5babc7eeba482450fde1743bad7f371f67fac511c1ff7dedf65df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:43:50.652546+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}